	(text "DRAFT – for ET review. SP4 VCC 2.0–3.6 V, ABS. MAX 3.6 V: feed it from the radio LDO or a bench supply,\nnever from the Li-ion cell or the Pi's 3V3 pin. >= 100 uF at the module (C1).\nHeader J1 = common nRF24 order; J2 = bench supply input (same VCC/GND).\nPi 3 wiring: radio/fw/linux/README.md. Footprint: Ebyte manual rev 1.7 p.4 (14.5 x 18 mm)."
